<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shipping Info - FreshMarket</title>
    <style>
        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
        body {
            background: url('/images/backgrounds/landing.jpg') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .nav, .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .nav { background:rgba(255,255,255,.98); padding:1rem 0; box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
        .container { width:90%; max-width:1200px; margin:2rem auto; }
        .nav-content { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
        .logo { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; color:#667eea; }
        .nav-links { display:flex; gap:1.5rem; }
        .nav-links a { color:#333; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; padding:.5rem 1rem; border-radius:.5rem; transition:all .2s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { background:#667eea; color:#fff; }
        
        .shipping-section {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 { color: #667eea; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        h2 { color: #667eea; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
        p { line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .info-box {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: .7rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="nav-content">
                <div class="logo">🛒 FreshMarket</div>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="/">Home</a>
                    <a href="/about">About</a>
                    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                    <% if (user) { %>
                        <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login">Login</a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="shipping-section">
            <h1>Shipping Information</h1>
            
            <h2>🚚 Delivery Options</h2>
            <div class="info-box">
                <h3>Standard Delivery (FREE on orders $50+)</h3>
                <p>• Delivery within 2-3 business days</p>
                <p>• $5 delivery fee for orders under $50</p>
                <p>• Available Monday to Sunday</p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <h3>Same-Day Delivery ($10)</h3>
                <p>• Order before 12pm for same-day delivery</p>
                <p>• Delivery between 3pm-9pm</p>
                <p>• Available in selected areas</p>
            </div>

            <h2>📦 Delivery Areas</h2>
            <p>We currently deliver to all areas in Singapore. Enter your postal code at checkout to verify delivery availability.</p>

            <h2>⏰ Delivery Time Slots</h2>
            <p>Choose your preferred delivery time slot at checkout:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left:2rem;color:#555">
                <li>9am - 12pm</li>
                <li>12pm - 3pm</li>
                <li>3pm - 6pm</li>
                <li>6pm - 9pm</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>📋 Order Tracking</h2>
            <p>Once your order is dispatched, you'll receive:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left:2rem;color:#555">
                <li>Email confirmation with tracking number</li>
                <li>SMS notification before delivery</li>
                <li>Real-time tracking in your account</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>❄️ Freshness Guarantee</h2>
            <p>All fresh products are carefully packed with ice packs and delivered in insulated bags to maintain optimal temperature.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
